{"id":"50b20f786d960883","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-directed-colimit-data.md","title":"Directed Colimits and Presentability Data","display":"df-directed-colimit-data — Directed Colimits and Presentability Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-directed-colimit-data","aliases":["58-df-directed-colimit-data"],"display":"df-directed-colimit-data — Directed Colimits and Presentability Data","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-directed-colimit-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-directed-colimit-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-directed-colimit-data — Directed Colimits and Presentability Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md\">../batch17/58-df-colimit.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,J,D,A,L,\\iota,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,J,D,A,L,\\iota,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>；范畴采用书中既有的六元集合编码，函子为对象映射与箭头映射的有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D)\">\\(D_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(D)\">\\(D_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(D)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_J,t_J\">\\(s_J,t_J\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的源、靶映射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gf=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f\">\\(gf=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a> 的实际复合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\">\\(\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md\">../batch17/58-df-colimit.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为无限正则基数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 采用薄范畴形式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-定向预序，即每个基数小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的对象族有共同上界；条件完整写在断言内。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是存在量化索引范畴的兼容投影；使用已指定索引范畴的地方还要明确满足对应的五元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\)</span>，不能借投影换用另一索引范畴。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" href=\"?note=2aed7ac2ed3313e0\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md\">../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\;f=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\left(|S|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall i\\in S\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\neq\\varnothing\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\;f=g)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\left(|S|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall i\\in S\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\neq\\varnothing\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(X,L,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(X,L,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(X,L,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(X,L,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,D,L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\iota(j)u=f)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(k))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(j)u=\\iota(k)v\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists l\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(j,l)\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(k,l)\\;D_1(a)u=D_1(b)v\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall J,D,L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\iota(j)u=f)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(k))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(j)u=\\iota(k)v\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad\\exists l\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(j,l)\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(k,l)\\;D_1(a)u=D_1(b)v\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>可表现性分别展开为经过某阶段的分解性，以及两种分解相等时在后续共同阶段相等；两条条件共同表达 Hom 保持定向余极限。</li>\n<li>本文件没有把原有集合编码范畴扩大为真类范畴，也没有把有限基数误当作可达性所需的无限正则基数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md","status":"resolved","id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D)$，$D_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(D)$。$s_J,t_J$ 是 $J$ 的源、靶映射；$gf=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f$ 使用 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的实际复合函数。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md","status":"resolved","id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)$；$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)$ 来自 [[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Category}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-abelian-category.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}$ 取 [[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Functor}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,J,D,A,L,\\iota,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D)","display":false},{"tex":"D_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(D)","display":false},{"tex":"s_J,t_J","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"gf=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Colimit}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall i,j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\;f=g)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\left(|S|<\\kappa\\to\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\forall i\\in S\\;\n\\operatorname{Hom}_J(i,j)\\neq\\varnothing\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasKappaDirectedColimits}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&\\land\\forall J,D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ColimitObject}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(L,D,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J,\\iota\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObjects}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(X,L,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IsomorphicObject}_S(X,L,\\mathcal C).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KappaPresentable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(A,\\mathcal C,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&\\land\\forall J,D,L,\\iota\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{KappaDirectedIndexCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(J,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,J,\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)\\to\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl[(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,L)\\;\n\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\iota(j)u=f)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall j,k\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\n\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(j))\\;\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,D_0(k))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\iota(j)u=\\iota(k)v\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad\\exists l\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(J)\\;\\exists a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(j,l)\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_J(k,l)\\;D_1(a)u=D_1(b)v\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4779,"backlinks":[{"id":"5d5e197234e9b36c","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"本文件的六个辅助谓词全部采用 [[58-df-directed-colimit-data.md]] 中的公式。$\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AccessibleCategory}_{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 仍为一元谓词。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-433","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-colimit-data.md|58-df-directed-colimit-data]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["e637becf421e4e61","d5e64f0c882e3eee","2aed7ac2ed3313e0","0fbfc19800246e77","877f1061e295cf5f","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}